# NCC: Documentation layout

## Law

**One docs home per module: `doc/`.**

| Allowed | |
|---------|--|
| `nixos/<module>/doc/**/*.md` | all human + assistant markdown |
| `README.md` / `CHANGELOG.md` at module root | entry stubs only |
| `<module>/ai/tools/*.json` + `ai/manifest.nix` | **not** docs — tool contracts |
| `<module>/prompts/` | runtime prompts (product), not manuals |

**Forbidden**

- `ai/docs/`
- `cli.md` / `usage.md` / `todo.md` / … at module root
- Parallel doc trees for the same module

Assistant markdown: `doc/ai-*.md` (discovered with the AI pack).

Repo-level cross-cutting docs stay in repo-root **`docs/`**.

Gate: `tests/validate-docs-layout.sh`.  
Guide: `docs/developing/docs-conventions.md`.
